    a synced skill and this one.
  - R2 the negation silently does nothing and the file stays untracked, so the
    fix ships as a no-op. Folded: both recipes were tried in a scratch repo
    first. Negating under an excluded directory leaves the file ignored,
    because git will not descend into an excluded directory.
